      "writtenOn": "2018-08-30T18:29:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since there isn\u0027t a corresponding dequeue method as a first class API, I am tempted to leave the name as it.\n\nThe caller (PD task) doesn\u0027t really know (or care) about the queue. I only need this function to be public because TCPC driver implementation need to be able to read a message in the the (hidden) queue.",
